<div class="guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">Welcome to Wowhead's Phase 3 Best in Slot Gear list for Blood Death Knight Tanks! While you'll see the increased item level of Ulduar gear make their way into the best in slot lists for DPS classes, it's not quite the same for Blood Death Knight Tanks. For the most part, tanks will prioritize EHP (Estimated Health Pool) over all damage for survivability. Even in trivial content, this can take more stress off of your healers especially if you drop some for farm. There are a lot of solid options in almost every slot, and we'll cover those below - but particularly in your offpiece slots like necks, rings, and trinkets.  We'll cover those below, but it's important to remember that these lists are made with progression for the next tier in mind as well. These lists might seem overkill for some bosses in ToC - but some bosses in ICC might require the beefyness that I've put together below. There's also multiple sets included, the reason being the length it's going to actually take to get all of your tier gear.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">Best in Slot Gear for Blood Death Knight Tanks in Phase 3</h2>The Blood Death Knight rule of thumb(s) doesn't change. EHP still comes out as king, and dodge is the best avoidance stat. It's too bad a lot of our options this tier are Parry heavy, which is already burdened by higher diminishing returns than Dodge. There's some movement here, especially looking at <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=49489/signified-ring-of-binding">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_13.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Signified Ring of Binding</span></a>. Talents can also come into play to help hit your spell hit breakpoints for Icy Touch if threat is an issue, or talents that increase it's damage. You'll notice both sets are relatively close in almost every value, but the tier set yields roughly a 6% decrease in DTPS.<div class="clear"></div>
