<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Blood Death Knight Tanks in Phase 3</h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="head">Heads for Blood Death Knight Tanks in Phase 3</h3>You'll mostly see <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47559/regalia-of-the-grand-vanquisher">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_chain_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Regalia of the Grand Vanquisher</span></a> go to DPS classes first, so collecting these might be a bit difficult. There are very solid alternatives to hold you over until you're able to snag them though.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=67839/mind-amplification-dish">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mind Amplification Dish</span></a> is easily our best, it requires Engineering (but everyone should be Engineering anyways). With the abundance of Defense on gear and the use of <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=62158/rune-of-the-stoneskin-gargoyle">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_130.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rune of the Stoneskin Gargoyle</span></a>, we won't need the Defense from <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50369/arcanum-of-the-stalwart-protector">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_warrior_swordandboard.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of the Stalwart Protector</span></a> but it is a solid second choice.<div class="pad"></div>
