<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="legs">Legs for Blood Death Knight Tanks in Phase 3</h3>With the 4pc bonus not being anything to truly write home about, we're really after the most stats possible when looking at our options. When comparing <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47061/legguards-of-feverish-dedication">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_20.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Legguards of Feverish Dedication</span></a>/<wbr/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47434/legplates-of-feverish-dedication">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_30.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Legplates of Feverish Dedication</span></a> to the tier, you'll find that they provide more Stamina thanks to the 3rd socket, equal strength, more defense, more parry (sadly), and trades the dodge for a solid chunk of expertise. They're the easy choice in this slot.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Leg Armor:</b> <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=60581/frosthide-leg-armor">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_leatherworking.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Frosthide Leg Armor</span></a> is the only solid option for tanks.<div class="pad"></div>
