<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="feet">Feet for Blood Death Knight Tanks in Phase 3</h3>These are one of the slots you can move around to get a bit more Hit if need be. The EHP differences between <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47003/dawnbreaker-greaves">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_plate_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dawnbreaker Greaves</span></a>/<wbr/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47430/dawnbreaker-sabatons">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_plate_09.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dawnbreaker Sabatons</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47952/sabatons-of-the-lingering-vortex">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_plate_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sabatons of the Lingering Vortex</span></a>/<wbr/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48024/greaves-of-the-lingering-vortex">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_plate_09.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greaves of the Lingering Vortex</span></a> are minimal, the ladder having 79 more armor, but 5 less Stamina. The major difference is the trade between 52 Parry rating and 47 Hit. I ultimately always recommend EHP first and foremost for a majority of the player base, but you really can't go wrong with either option.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Feet Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=55016/nitro-boosts">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nitro Boosts</span></a> for movement speed, <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=39006/scroll-of-enchant-boots-tuskarrs-vitality">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_scroll_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Scroll of Enchant Boots - Tuskarr's Vitality</span></a> for balance, <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=38966/scroll-of-enchant-boots-greater-fortitude">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_scroll_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Scroll of Enchant Boots - Greater Fortitude</span></a> for full chonk.<div class="pad"></div>
